    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/34e2e36481d225aa573d0aaa115c2944.poster.avif?t=1746017096\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/34e2e36481d225aa573d0aaa115c2944.webm?t=1746017096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/34e2e36481d225aa573d0aaa115c2944.mp4?t=1746017096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hit the arrow on the cherry. Sounds simple? Try it. <br><strong>Archerry Storm</strong> is a 2D arcade game with a minimalist aesthetic and varied mechanics, as intuitive as they are challenging. Increasingly difficult obstacles in multiple game modes will demand the most of your precision. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels with progressively increasing and balanced challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, simple, and challenging mechanics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 game modes/difficulty levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant and enjoyable neon/retro aesthetic;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, casual, and highly replayable. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game tests the player, it becomes a matter of honor. Are you ready to master the perfect shot?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/34e2e36481d225aa573d0aaa115c2944.poster.avif?t=1746017096\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/34e2e36481d225aa573d0aaa115c2944.webm?t=1746017096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453660/extras/34e2e36481d225aa573d0aaa115c2944.mp4?t=1746017096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Hit the arrow on the cherry. Sounds simple? Try it. <br><strong>Archerry Storm</strong> is a 2D arcade game with a minimalist aesthetic and varied mechanics, as intuitive as they are challenging. Increasingly difficult obstacles in multiple game modes will demand the most of your precision. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 levels with progressively increasing and balanced challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, simple, and challenging mechanics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 game modes/difficulty levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant and enjoyable neon/retro aesthetic;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive, casual, and highly replayable. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game tests the player, it becomes a matter of honor. Are you ready to master the perfect shot?</p>",
